     ],
     "value": "Binds specifically to cytosolic chaperonin (c-CPN) and transfers target proteins to it. Binds to nascent polypeptide chain and promotes folding in an environment in which there are many competing pathways for nonnative proteins"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
